   Fujita, Kazuhiko; Okai, Takaaki, Univ Ryukyus, Dept Phys \& Earth Sci, Nishihara, Okinawa 90301, Japan.
   Hosono, Takashi, Univ Tokyo, Grad Sch Sci, Dept Earth \& Planetary Sci, Tokyo 113, Japan.},
