Number = {5-6},
Pages = {451-464},
Abstract = {Studies on Late Miocene isotope stratigraphy are summarized. The results
   as studied using simple models. Additional evidence is presented that
   the .delta. 13C shift {[}of benthic and planktonic foraminifera] at 6.2
   millian yr B.P. was a time-stratigfaphic event. The average deep-water
